---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Funding Calls – EU Programmes for Dance-Medicine Research | CENIT e.V."
  canonical="https://cenit-ev.de/en/foerderaufrufe/"
  description="A curated overview of current EU funding programmes relevant to dance-medicine research and prevention – from COST to Erasmus+ Sport. Continuously updated by CENIT e.V."
  bodyClass="page-einblicke"
>
  <!-- HERO -->
  <section class="cenit-section page-einblicke-hero">
    <div class="cenit-container">
      <div class="cenit-heroimg reveal" style="--reveal-delay:0ms">
        <img
          src="/assets/img/hero-foerderaufrufe.jpg"
          alt="Abstract blurred black and white photograph of dancers on pointe in motion"
          loading="eager">
        <div class="cenit-heroimg-overlay">
          <h1 class="cenit-heroimg-title reveal" style="--reveal-delay:140ms">
            
            <span data-lang="en">Funding Calls</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="cenit-lead reveal" style="--reveal-delay:220ms; text-align:left; margin:0;">
            
            <span data-lang="en">
              Current EU funding programmes relevant to dance medicine research, movement science and prevention.
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cenit-section">
    <div class="cenit-container">

      <!-- Intro-Panel -->
      <div class="cenit-card cenit-einblicke-panel reveal" style="--reveal-delay:80ms; margin-bottom:24px;">
        <p style="font-size:12px; letter-spacing:0.08em; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--cenit-purple); margin:0 0 10px 0; font-weight:600;">
          
          <span data-lang="en">Enabling Research</span>
        </p>
        <div style="height:1px; background:rgba(0,0,0,0.07); margin:0 0 18px 0;"></div>
        <div class="cenit-foerder-intro">
          <p class="cenit-foerder-intro-quote">
            
            <span data-lang="en">Making funding opportunities visible, not just listing them.</span>
          </p>
          <div class="cenit-gold-divider" style="margin:14px auto;"></div>
          <p class="cenit-foerder-intro-note">
            
            <span data-lang="en">
              As part of our commitment to "enabling research," CENIT e.V. continuously curates publicly accessible EU funding programmes relevant to dance medicine research, movement science, and prevention in competitive sport and dance. The European funding landscape is fragmented and rarely tailored to the needs of a small, interdisciplinary field such as dance medicine – we aim to make it more visible and accessible for universities, researchers, and professional associations in our network.
            </span>
          </p>
        </div>
        <p style="font-size:12px; color:var(--muted-foreground); font-style:italic; text-align:center; margin:14px 0 0 0;">
          
          <span data-lang="en">Last updated: November 2026 · This selection is not exhaustive and does not replace independent verification of eligibility conditions.</span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Card-Gruppen -->
      <div class="cenit-foerder-groups">

        <!-- ===== AKTUELL OFFEN ===== -->
        <h2 class="cenit-h3 cenit-einblicke-h" style="margin:0 0 14px 0;">
          
          <span data-lang="en">Currently Open</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="cenit-foerder-row cenit-foerder-row--wide">

          <!-- MSCA Doctoral Networks 2026 -->
          <div class="cenit-foerder-card is-dark">
            <p class="cenit-radar-kicker">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Horizon Europe · Marie Skłodowska-Curie Actions · Doctoral Networks 2026</span>
            </p>
            <h3 class="cenit-radar-headline">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Doctoral networks with non-academic partners</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="cenit-foerder-status">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Open since 28 May 2026 · Deadline 24 November 2026, 17:00 Brussels time</span>
            </p>
            <p class="cenit-foerder-body">
              
              <span data-lang="en">
                Doctoral Networks fund international doctoral training programmes combining academic and non-academic partners – with an indicative total budget of around €593 million across all scientific fields. Universities wishing to supervise doctoral research on dance-medicine questions can involve non-academic partners such as CENIT as Associated Partners, for example to provide practical insight or host short doctoral secondments. Applications are led and coordinated by academic institutions; for CENIT this would be conceivable as a supporting network partner, should a suitable university collaboration arise. The deadline is only a few weeks away – but for consortia already in preparation, a partnership can still make sense at short notice.
              </span>
            </p>
            <a class="cenit-btn" href="https://marie-sklodowska-curie-actions.ec.europa.eu/actions/doctoral-networks" target="_blank" rel="noopener">marie-sklodowska-curie-actions.ec.europa.eu<svg class="cenit-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></a>
          </div>

        </div>

        <!-- ===== IM BLICK BEHALTEN ===== -->
        <h2 class="cenit-h3 cenit-einblicke-h" style="margin:28px 0 14px 0;">
          
          <span data-lang="en">On the Watchlist</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="cenit-foerder-row">

          <!-- Erasmus+ Sport – Runde 2027 -->
          <div class="cenit-foerder-card is-dark">
            <p class="cenit-radar-kicker">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Erasmus+ Sport · Cooperation Partnerships &amp; Small-scale Partnerships</span>
            </p>
            <h3 class="cenit-radar-headline">
              
              <span data-lang="en">2027 work programme adopted – call expected shortly</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="cenit-foerder-status is-watch">
              
              <span data-lang="en">2027 annual work programme adopted on 15 October 2026 · 2027 call and Programme Guide not yet published</span>
            </p>
            <p class="cenit-foerder-body">
              
              <span data-lang="en">
                Erasmus+ Sport funds transnational partnerships (at least three organisations from three programme countries) on topics such as health-enhancing physical activity, coach education, or good-practice exchange – organisationally and financially more accessible than Horizon Europe research funding. The European Commission adopted the 2027 annual work programme in mid-October; last year, the call itself and the Programme Guide followed in mid-November. The deadline for sport partnerships was most recently in early March. Anyone planning a partnership should therefore prepare their consortium and project idea now – we will update this entry once concrete dates are published.
              </span>
            </p>
            <a class="cenit-btn" href="https://erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu/opportunities/opportunities-for-organisations/sport-actions/cooperation-partnerships" target="_blank" rel="noopener">erasmus-plus.ec.europa.eu<svg class="cenit-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></a>
          </div>

          <!-- COST – nächster Open Call -->
          <div class="cenit-foerder-card">
            <p class="cenit-radar-kicker">
              
              <span data-lang="en">COST – European Cooperation in Science and Technology · Open Call</span>
            </p>
            <h3 class="cenit-radar-headline">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Networking, not research funding: COST Actions for European science networks</span>
            </h3>
            <p class="cenit-foerder-status is-watch">
              
              <span data-lang="en">Open Call 2026 closed (deadline 28 October 2026) · next Open Call not yet announced</span>
            </p>
            <p class="cenit-foerder-body">
              
              <span data-lang="en">
                COST does not fund research itself, but the build-up of four-year, interdisciplinary science networks ("COST Actions") – covering networking meetings, training schools, short-term scientific missions and dissemination, not staff or lab costs. An Action requires participants from at least seven COST member countries, at least 50% of which from so-called Inclusiveness Target Countries, and at least 40% early-career researchers and innovators. The 2026 deadline has passed; funding decisions on submitted proposals are made within seven months. The Open Call runs annually, but dates for the next round have not yet been published. For an emerging network such as dance medicine in Europe, COST remains a low-threshold entry point: applicants are typically research institutions, while civil-society organisations such as CENIT can join as network partners.
              </span>
            </p>
            <a class="cenit-btn" href="https://www.cost.eu/how-to-apply/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cost.eu<svg class="cenit-arrow-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line><polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline></svg></a>
          </div>

        </div>

      </div>

      <!-- Quellenhinweis & Disclaimer -->
      <div class="cenit-card cenit-einblicke-panel reveal" style="--reveal-delay:80ms; margin-top:24px;">
        <p style="font-size:12px; color:var(--muted-foreground); line-height:1.6; max-width:var(--cenit-axis-760);">
          
          <span data-lang="en">
            CENIT e.V. does not act as an applicant itself here. We make existing EU funding programmes visible and provide our own interpretation – this does not constitute legal or funding advice and does not replace reading the official programme guides and call texts. The original sources always take precedence: the COST Association (COST Actions), the European Research Executive Agency REA (Marie Skłodowska-Curie Actions), and the European Education and Culture Executive Agency EACEA (Erasmus+ Sport).
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* Förderaufrufe-spezifische Styles (lokal, kein Eingriff in main.css) */
  .cenit-radar-kicker {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    font-style: italic;
    margin: 0 0 5px 0;
  }
  .cenit-radar-headline {
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.3;
    color: var(--cenit-purple);
    margin: 0 0 8px 0;
  }
  .cenit-foerder-status {
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    margin: 0 0 14px 0;
  }
  .cenit-foerder-status.is-watch {
    font-style: italic;
  }
  .cenit-foerder-body {
    font-size: 13.5px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
  }

  /* ============ Intro-Panel (im Glossar-Stil) ============ */
  .cenit-foerder-intro{
    text-align: center;
    max-width: var(--cenit-axis-760);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .cenit-foerder-intro-quote{
    font-family: 'EB Garamond', serif;
    font-style: italic;
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: 22px;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--cenit-purple);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .cenit-foerder-intro-note{
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--muted-foreground);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ============ Förderaufrufe-Karten (im FAQ-/Glossar-Stil) ============ */
  .cenit-foerder-groups{
    max-width: var(--cenit-axis-950);
    margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .cenit-foerder-row{
    background: #ffffff;
    border-radius: 22px;
    padding: 18px;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 18px;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
    align-items: stretch;
  }
  .cenit-foerder-row--wide{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  @media (max-width: 860px){
    .cenit-foerder-row{ grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
  }
  .cenit-foerder-card{
    background: #f5f3f9;
    border-radius: 18px;
    padding: 22px 26px;
    box-shadow: none;
  }
  .cenit-foerder-card.is-dark{ background: #edebf5; }

  @media (max-width: 480px){
    .cenit-foerder-card{ padding: 20px; }
  }

  /* Pfeil-Icon statt Unicode-Zeichen (↗ wird auf iOS/mobil als Farb-Emoji
     in eigenem Kästchen dargestellt, passt nicht zum Layout) */
  .cenit-arrow-icon{
    width: 0.85em;
    height: 0.85em;
    margin-left: 5px;
    vertical-align: -0.05em;
    display: inline-block;
  }
</style>
